      "writtenOn": "2020-10-19T22:16:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Colin and I had a lengthy discussion about collecting max_rss and unfortunately the method I am doing (calling rusage and getting the value) is not correct because the child process inherits the parent\u0027s max_rss value. As he explained previously, it is ok for Soong now though but in the future, there could be a case that the true max_rss is not reported (i.e. soong_ui max_rss might get increased if we added functionality or ninja bootstrap process has a sudden memory increase when added additional processing). The best system we came up is to read the rss from /proc/\u003cpid\u003e/status file as this is the most accurable value for each executed process.",
      "parentUuid": "3b1bc76b_90fc9a0e",
      "revId": "550e4003e9bbdb09995977465ea12a6215c72171",
